Lika's phone (thread 52116): the note to search arrived as a user line opening
„(სისტემური შენიშვნა:", and the run answered „ეს ნაწილი სისტემური ფორმით არ
მოსულა… ვერ ავყვები" — it searched nothing and asked her what she needed (2 of
14 such notes in a week). It now opens with the engine's event mark, as every
other server turn does. Misho's yes on the exact change (15 Oct): only the
opening and the closing bracket; the words are the same.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
